# Build context for the runtime image: the release binary alone. Nothing is
# compiled on the VPS. `pr/base` built and tested this binary, `deploy/backend`
# copied it to `.deploy/incoming/`, and this whitelist keeps the context a few
# megabytes instead of the whole checkout.
#
# `*` first, then the exception. Docker applies the patterns in order and does not
# descend into an excluded directory, so each parent of a wanted file is
# re-included explicitly; a bare `!path/file` under an excluded directory is
# silently ignored.
*
!deploy
!deploy/Dockerfile
!.deploy
!.deploy/incoming
!.deploy/incoming/logandaim-server
